WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Zhang Yi

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,720
Fang Yuqing is in our hands now

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:05,160
If you want to take her away, give her antibiotics and other medicines in exchange

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,440
There are too many people and I dare not go there.

5
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,600
I'm afraid you will take the opportunity to attack Qin'er

6
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,760
It’s not that my brother doesn’t want to pick you up

7
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:10,800
It's because they won't let you go

8
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,460
don't blame me

9
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,700
This woman is extremely selfish

10
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,580
You only have eyes for yourself and you think highly of her

11
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,900
We can't let her escape privately

12
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,060
Don't worry, Sister Wang

13
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,620
We have to suffer together.

14
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,580
Why should she live a good life alone?

15
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,140
Only basic wound treatment was done

16
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,420
Without antibiotics, there is a high probability of severe infection.

17
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,660
Be mentally prepared

18
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:35,340
We can't sit still and wait for death

19
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,700
We must get antibiotics from Zhang Yi

20
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,460
No man to protect you

21
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,860
There's no way you women can survive in the ink corpse.

22
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,500
Zhangyijiazhuang Bilu

23
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,980
Must stockpile massive amounts of fuel and sufficient food

24
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,040
Since her security function cannot be broken,

25
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,840
Send the message directly to everyone
